-- The definition half of a cross-IMPORT pair for the built-in connectives.
-- See ok/section-given-import-connective-call.l4, which imports this file.
--
-- A section GIVEN with a default, and a BOOLEAN rule that reads it. Once this
-- module is discharged, the rule takes `the rate` as a trailing input, so an
-- importer that names it reaches a closure that still has to be applied to
-- this module's own cell before it is a BOOLEAN.

§ `Flags`
    GIVEN `the rate` IS A NUMBER TYPICALLY 5

GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`rate is high` MEANS `the rate` GREATER THAN 3

GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`rate is low` MEANS `the rate` LESS THAN 3

#EVAL `rate is high`
#EVAL `rate is low`
